  "boundary": "Research evidence supplies mechanism priors, applicability context, falsifying evidence and next-measurement suggestions. Adaptive practice uses learner-scoped local aggregate events and never changes formal assessment content or production authority. Progression requires demonstrated transfer across distinct structured run contexts, delayed 7/30-day checks test retention, and formative difficulty calibration is disabled until anonymous device-local sample thresholds are met. Aggregate effectiveness exports contain no learner tokens, names, answer text, notes or event timestamps. Production decisions remain governed by local measured evidence, validated process limits, machine/tool/material documentation, approved site procedures and applicable safety controls."
